Modifications in this copy
--------------------------

This directory is a modified copy of skills/plain-language from
https://github.com/auxesis/plain-language-skill at commit b001fa6,
distributed under the Apache License 2.0 in LICENSE. CipherStash made
these changes:

- core.md moved to references/core.md, and SKILL.md tells the agent to
  read it instead of relying on a session hook;
- the plugin's hooks are not included, and SKILL.md, references/core.md,
  and the comment in scripts/rules.json no longer describe them;
- SKILL.md's description, checker command, and checker notes were
  adapted for Codex and Claude Code;
- tests/test_check.py keeps only the tests for the checker scripts.
